# Dacia Sandero II five-door hatchback, 2013-2020.
#
# The budget Renault-based supermini sold in Britain from 2013: 4,091 mm long,
# 1,733 mm wide, 1,523 mm high, 2,589 mm wheelbase; 0.9-1.6 petrol and 1.5
# diesel. Britain's cheapest new car of the mid-2010s.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dacia_Sandero
#
# Colours: White, Red, Blue and Grey are documented Dacia colours of the period.
#
# Weight: 40 in total (white 14, red 10, blue 9, grey 7).
#
# Speed 170 km/h; comfort 85/458 (line). Classes 0,1.
# Dates: 2013-2020 with a road tail to about 2030.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/dacia-sandero.blend. References:
# citycars/references/dacia-sandero/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

